ly, delays fulfillment of client requests.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Office 5</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Office 5 is one of 32 branches of offices maintained by the R.F.C. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new client recently chose Office 5 to be responsible for all of its requests. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to ensure consistent fulfillment, new employees and transfers must report to the Office 5 Verification Center.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The top priority of Office 5 is to ensure the continuation of client request fulfillment,\u00a0regardless of an employees circumstance.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Unverified Person Discrepancy Alarm (U.P.D.A.)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887040/extras/75e8f492fa0c1dc543bb92862c56b800.poster.avif?t=1768251206\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887040/extras/75e8f492fa0c1dc543bb92862c56b800.webm?t=1768251206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887040/extras/75e8f492fa0c1dc543bb92862c56b800.mp4?t=1768251206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the unlikely event security detects the presence of an unverified person, the &quot;U.P.D.A&quot; will inform employees. Employees will be trained to escape to a safe place until help arrives.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887040/extras/cbaea35fa54e9769906b87a237a6df7e.poster.avif?t=1768251206\" width=1170 hei